Package: vabaxos-update
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gir1.2-packagekitglib-1.0, packagekit, flatpak
Recommends: fwupd
Description: Update VabaxOS with every step said aloud
 A window with what there is to update (security, system, Flatpak
 applications, firmware), the history of the updates and the settings of
 the automatic check. Updates are installed now or at the next start; the
 progress is said every 25 percent. Updates that change the desktop or the
 voice (GNOME Shell, Orca, PipeWire, the kernel) are advised at the next
 start (ADR-0020). Also from the terminal: vabaxos-update --now. The
 automatic check speaks only when security updates are ready, unless the
 user asks for all of them.
